<title>USA: Dynamic Imaging completes purchase.</title>
<headline>Dynamic Imaging completes purchase.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynamic Imaging Systems Corp said Wednesday it completed the acquisition of The Lasersmith Inc, which produces advanced imaging and new Internet technologies.</p>
<p>The acquisition was a business combination transaction whereby both companies exchanged their common stock.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
